#: main.py:538
msgid "Apply the per-bone translation from VMC as well as the rotation, measured against the first pose received so the sender's own rest offsets are not added to your rig. Some senders animate humanoid bones by rotation alone, so this has no effect with them."
msgstr "除旋转外，同时应用 VMC 的逐骨骼位移。位移以收到的第一个姿势为基准测量，因此发送端自身的静止偏移不会叠加到你的骨架上。有些发送端仅通过旋转驱动人形骨骼，此时该选项无效。"

